WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.880
Making sure people are
happy, having a good time.

2
00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:09.610
All those values that I grew up
getting to see my dad, you know,

3
00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:15.110
just be this incredible hospitality human
being for the family and his friends

4
00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:17.660
around him, and then also
coupling that with Moshe.

5
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.730
Man, I got to tell you, the two
of them in a room at the Rondo,

6
00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:25.030
forget about it. That was like the
coolest place I've ever been in my life,

7
00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:31.070
seeing these two men just have
so much fun and get people

8
00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:32.560
excited about life.
